012400*---------- PARMS FOR CALL TO FCHECK, FERRMSG INTRINSICS
012500*
012600*01  FCHECK-ERROR-NUM                PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
012700*01  FCHECK-MSG                      PIC X(72) VALUE SPACES.
012800*01  FCHECK-MSG-LENGTH               PIC S9(4) COMP-4 VALUE 0.
012900*
013000*---------- PARMS FOR CALL TO FWRITE INTRINSIC
013100
013200 01  TARGET.
013300     05  CONTROL-CHARACTER         PIC X(1).
013310     05  TG-AREA.
013400         10  FILLER                PIC X(25) VALUE SPACES.
013500         10  TG-MIDDLE             PIC X(80) VALUE SPACES.
013600         10  FILLER                PIC X(26) VALUE SPACES.
013700
013800*----------  INTRINSIC "COMMAND"
013900*01  COMMAND-AREA.
014000*    05  COMMAND-IMAGE.
014100*        10  COMMAND                 PIC X(81) VALUE SPACES.
014200*        10  FILLER                  PIC X(1)   VALUE %15.
014300*    05  COMMAND-ERROR               PIC 9(4)  COMP-4 VALUE 0.
014400*    05  COMMAND-PARM                PIC 9(4)  COMP-4 VALUE 0.
014500*
      *------ FOR IBM COMMAND TO OVERRIDE DATABASE FILE
       01  COMMAND         PIC X(70).
       01  COMMAND-LEN     PIC S9(10)V9(5) COMP-3 VALUE 70.

014600 01  FILE-COMMAND.
014700     05  FILLER           PIC X(13) VALUE "FILE DHDFILE=".
014800     05  COMMAND-FILE-NAME PIC X(17)  VALUE SPACES.
014900
015000**************************************************************
015100**                                                          **
015200**       H E A D E R   &   D E T A I L   L I N E S          **
015300**                                                          **
